~ start

: The game was almost ready. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/intro_developer_room.png] [#fade_in]
: One final build before release.
: A whole world, waiting to be shared.

: But something was wrong.
: Some players could not read what the world was trying to say.
: Some could not distinguish the signals that opened the way.
: Some could not find the information they needed to continue.

: At first, it looked like a bug. Another issue to fix before launch.
: But the problem was not hidden in the code alone. It was hidden in the way the world had been designed.

: Then, the screen began to glow. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/intro_screen_glow.png] [#cinematic=2.5]
: Lines of code twisted into light. Errors became fragments of color.
: And from inside the monitor, the world called back.

: Before you could react, the light pulled you in. [#fade_out=4.0]
: The desk, the room, the screen...
: Everything disappeared.

: You crossed the boundary between developer and world. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/intro_prism_lands.png] [#fade_in=5.5] [#cinematic=4.0]
: The Lands of the Prism were no longer just pixels. They were alive.
: And they were waiting to be understood.

???: Welcome, developer. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/intro_archivist.png] [#cinematic=2.5]
???: You have crossed the screen and entered the world you created. But this world reflects more than your imagination.
???: It also reflects what you could not yet see.

???: The Prism does not reveal flaws in people.
???: It reveals the barriers hidden in the world.
???: A sign that depends only on color. A text that cannot be read clearly.
???: A path that gives no information to those who perceive it differently.

???: To heal this world, you must first learn to perceive it through other experiences.

???: Take the Mirror of Resonance. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/intro_archivist_mirror.png] [#cinematic=0.5] [#show_mirror]
???: It will not need to be used by hand. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/intro_mirror.png] [#cinematic=0.5]
???: When someone faces a hidden barrier, the Mirror will awaken and reveal their experience to you.
???: Not to judge them.
???: But to understand what the world asks of them. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/intro_archivist_mirror.png]

???: And take the Resonance Codex. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/intro_archivist_mirror_codex.png] [#cinematic=0.5] [#show_codex]
???: You may open it whenever you wish. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/intro_codex.png] [#cinematic=0.5]
???: It will record your discoveries.
???: Within its pages, you will find knowledge that every developer should carry.
???: Knowledge about accessibility, design, and the many ways people interact with digital worlds.

???: Help the inhabitants of the Lands of the Prism. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/intro_archivist_mirror_codex.png]
???: Listen to their needs. Understand the barriers.
???: Then reshape the world so that more people can move through it.

???: Only then will your game truly be ready. [#fade_out=5.0]

: Your journey begins now. 
=> END